        {
          "end": 44,
          "raw": "<interval=0.4>",
          "start": 30
        }
      ],
      "jp": "悪魔モンスター娘を突き崩すために、\n別の勢力の力を借りる……<interval=0.4>というのが現実的だと思うんですが。",
      "jp_sha256": "70e9f78370e559ff7857b7d7aae7c64ec2d1040649e7f464af5b65b98428875b",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "악마 몬스터 소녀의 진형을 무너뜨리려면,\n다른 세력의 힘을 빌리는……<interval=0.4> 것이 현실적이라고 생각합니다만.",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 14,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b011-20261107-ff47d2c5b69e",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "e4b8391ebcecd341a4da637dd7d44c9ea075ec5fe11d2e62d587254ed92bd443:000002_3937946050235739821:g0:r13",
      "row_index_0based": 13,
      "serialized_row_index": 13,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "悪魔モンスター娘を突き崩すために、\n別の勢力の力を借りる……<interval=0.4>というのが現実的だと思うんですが。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "b3d5409a40591a0d4bdb7026d31d93d27b307310b6448903e0c7c87245018a16",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 3,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "別の勢力……というからには、\nどこかの国の力を頼るという訳ではないんだな？",
      "jp_sha256": "3a7a44c7e1a193af98f7c16f67346945bb08a509e244362f0f2092ad40245cf2",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "다른 세력……이라고 하는 걸 보면\n어느 나라의 힘을 빌리겠다는 뜻은 아니군?",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 15,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b011-20261107-ff47d2c5b69e",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
