        {
          "end": 62,
          "raw": "<interval=0.4>",
          "start": 48
        }
      ],
      "jp": "そうです。<interval=0.4>\n国家の力を持ち出すと、結局、侵略戦争になってしまいます。<interval=0.4>\nそれは何とかして避けたいんですよ。",
      "jp_sha256": "1a4eff358b762d6834382dfd01eb735dba2235d7edfb7ab9b3c71f3c01c2e547",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그렇습니다.<interval=0.4>\n국가의 힘을 끌어들이면 결국 침략 전쟁이 됩니다.<interval=0.4>\n그건 어떻게든 피하고 싶어요.",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 18,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b011-20261107-ff47d2c5b69e",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "e4b8391ebcecd341a4da637dd7d44c9ea075ec5fe11d2e62d587254ed92bd443:000002_3937946050235739821:g0:r17",
      "row_index_0based": 17,
      "serialized_row_index": 17,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "そうです。<interval=0.4>\n国家の力を持ち出すと、結局、侵略戦争になってしまいます。<interval=0.4>\nそれは何とかして避けたいんですよ。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
